MODULE 2: PREPARE YOUR MACHINE LEARNING PROJECT
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

INTRODUCTION:

- Now, let’s get ready to simulate building an AI model with IBM Watson Studio. In this module, you
    will learn about the scenario for your project. You’ll also get practice in a simulation to set
    up a new project in IBM Watson Studio and import data.


LEARNING OBJECTIVES:

- After completing this module, you should be able to:
    -> Set up a machine learning project in IBM Watson Studio
    -> Create a Cloud Object Storage resource
    -> Import a data set into IBM Watson Studio